IMPORT prelude
IMPORT domain

-- g5-test-conduct.l4: Chapter 5, Subchapter B of the Regulation of Engagement in Work on Refrigeration or
-- Air-Conditioning Systems Law 5785-2025: ss.37 and 38 (the powers of testers and experts, the four conditions of
-- entry, the publication of the checklist; information security, return and destruction, and confidentiality).
--
-- Written by ENCODER G5.  Imports only prelude and domain.  Inputs: that the tester or expert holds an
-- authorisation under s.36 that is in force (g5-withdrawal and g5-testing-bodies decide it), that an engagement
-- was made under s.34(c) (the Mandatory Tenders Law is outside the sources), the senior inspector's reason to
-- suppose, and the occupier's consent and what he was told.  A power is a MAY rule guarded by PROVIDED; "only if
-- all of these" (s.37(b)) is also a SHANT rule; duties are MUST rules; the duty and the prohibition of s.38 arise
-- by IF ... ELSE FULFILLED or by a guard that names the engagement.
-- No period is met in ss.37 and 38 (s.38(b) fixes no time for the hand-over, the destruction or the notice).

§ `Chapter 5, Subchapter B: the conduct of testers and experts`

§§ `Nouns of ss 37 and 38`

-- s.37(a): one constructor for each power, named for the act.
DECLARE `Power of a tester or an expert under section 37(a)` IS ONE OF
    `enter a place for the purpose of auxiliary tests or an expert opinion`                      -- (1)
    `require the person doing the work to give his name and address and to show identification`  -- (2)
    `use a checklist`                                                                            -- (3)
    `receive from a person concerned the documents or information that appear in the checklist`  -- (4)
    `carry out tests on a cooling system`                                                        -- (5)

DECLARE `Capacity under section 37` IS ONE OF
    `acting as a tester`
    `acting as an expert`

-- Who is acting and why (s.37(a) lead-in), apart from what each power adds.
DECLARE `Tester or expert at work` HAS
    `capacity` IS A `Capacity under section 37`
    `holds an authorisation under section 36 that is in force` IS A BOOLEAN
    `acting to carry out an auxiliary test` IS A BOOLEAN
    `acting to give an expert opinion` IS A BOOLEAN
    `within the conditions and instructions in the instrument of authorisation` IS A BOOLEAN   -- s.36(d), "by kind of auxiliary test"
    `the Law has commenced for the work on the system being tested` IS A BOOLEAN               -- s.63(a), IP2: G7 decides it

-- s.37(a)(1) with s.37(b): everything about an entry.
DECLARE `Entry by a tester or an expert under section 37` HAS
    `the senior inspector has reason to suppose that a person operating there does work on a cooling system without a licence or not in accordance with the conditions of his licence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the senior inspector has reason to suppose that a person operating there engages another in such work without a licence or not in accordance with the conditions of the licence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `showed the instrument of authorisation to the holder of the place` IS A BOOLEAN                       -- (b)(1)
    `the holder gave written consent to the entry` IS A BOOLEAN                                            -- (b)(2)
    `the holder was told the purpose of the tests` IS A BOOLEAN                                            -- (b)(3)
    `the holder was told of his right to refuse the tests` IS A BOOLEAN                                    -- (b)(3)
    `the holder was told of his right to withdraw consent until the tests begin` IS A BOOLEAN              -- (b)(3)
    `the holder was told all this before he gave consent` IS A BOOLEAN                                     -- (b)(3)
    `the holder withdrew his consent before the tests began` IS A BOOLEAN                                  -- (b)(3), fork F-WITHDRAW
    `used as a dwelling` IS A BOOLEAN                                                                      -- (b)(4)
    `the holder asked for the entry` IS A BOOLEAN                                                          -- (b)(4)
    `the entry was arranged with the holder in advance` IS A BOOLEAN                                       -- (b)(4)

-- s.37(a)(3): the checklist the senior inspector set (s.33 def.7) and the publication it carries.
DECLARE `Checklist used by a tester or an expert` HAS
    `set by the senior inspector for the carrying out of an auxiliary test` IS A BOOLEAN
    `published in Reshumot and on the Ministry website` IS A BOOLEAN

-- s.37(a)(4).
DECLARE `Request for documents or information under a checklist` HAS
    `the person from whom they are requested is concerned in the matter` IS A BOOLEAN
    `they appear in the checklist` IS A BOOLEAN

-- s.38(a): what securing the information includes ("including preventing misuse, supervising and controlling
-- access to the information and its use, and securing the computer systems in which it is held").
DECLARE `Measures securing information under section 38(a)` HAS
    `misuse of the information is prevented` IS A BOOLEAN
    `access to the information and its use are supervised and controlled` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the computer systems in which the information is held are secured` IS A BOOLEAN
    `any other aspect of security that the responsibility requires is secured` IS A BOOLEAN   -- "including" leaves the list open

DECLARE `Engagement for information security` HAS
    `made in accordance with section 34(c)` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `End of an engagement under section 38(b)` HAS
    `the engagement was made in accordance with section 34(c)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the engagement has ended` IS A BOOLEAN
    `information remains after it was handed to the senior inspector` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Information obtained by a tester, an expert or a testing body` HAS
    `obtained in an act under an engagement made in accordance with section 34(c)` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `An act under sections 37 and 38` IS ONE OF
    `use a power of a tester or an expert` HAS `the power used by the tester or expert` IS A `Power of a tester or an expert under section 37(a)`
    `publish the checklist in Reshumot and on the Ministry website`
    `secure the information received in the course of an act under the engagement`
        HAS `the measures taken to secure it` IS A `Measures securing information under section 38(a)`
    `hand the information to the senior inspector`
    `destroy the information that remains`
    `tell the senior inspector that the information was destroyed`
    `disclose or use information obtained in an act under the engagement`
        HAS `in order to perform the act` IS A BOOLEAN
            `the Law requires it under section 34(d), 34(e) or 38(b)` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `s 37 -- Acts of testers and experts`

-- src:306 | {{ח:סעיף|37|פעולות בודקים ומומחים}}
-- src:307 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} לשם ביצוע בדיקות עזר או מתן חוות דעת מומחה, רשאי בודק או מומחה, לפי העניין –
-- The lead-in: "for carrying out auxiliary tests or giving expert opinions, a tester or expert, as the case may
-- be, may": a tester for auxiliary tests, an expert for auxiliary tests or opinions.  Each power also needs the
-- authorisation of s.36 in force (an input: see g5-withdrawal) and to be within the instrument's conditions.
@ref s.37(a) (src:307)
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(a) — the purpose fits the capacity` who MEANS
    CONSIDER who's `capacity`
    WHEN `acting as a tester` THEN who's `acting to carry out an auxiliary test`
    WHEN `acting as an expert` THEN who's `acting to carry out an auxiliary test` OR who's `acting to give an expert opinion`

@ref s.37(a) (src:307)
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(a) — the tester or expert holds the power: authorised, acting for a purpose that fits his capacity, within the conditions of his instrument, the Law having commenced for the work` who MEANS
        who's `holds an authorisation under section 36 that is in force`
    AND `s 37(a) — the purpose fits the capacity` who
    AND who's `within the conditions and instructions in the instrument of authorisation`
    AND who's `the Law has commenced for the work on the system being tested`

@ref s.37(a) (src:307)
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work`
GIVETH A Party
`s 37 — the party acting as` who MEANS
    CONSIDER who's `capacity`
    WHEN `acting as a tester` THEN `a tester`
    WHEN `acting as an expert` THEN `an expert`

-- src:308 | {{ח:תתת|(1)}} להיכנס, בכפוף להוראות סעיף קטן (ב), למקום שיש למפקח הבכיר יסוד להניח שפועל בו אדם המבצע עבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר בלא רישיון או שלא בהתאם לתנאי הרישיון שלו או שאדם מפעיל בו אדם אחר בביצוע עבודה כאמור בלא רישיון או שלא בהתאם לתנאי הרישיון שלו;
-- s.37(a)(1): the place is one where the SENIOR inspector (not the tester or expert, and not "an inspector" as in
-- s.31(3)) has reason to suppose unlicensed or non-conforming work is done or engaged.  Entry is "subject to
-- (b)".
@ref s.37(a)(1) (src:308)
GIVEN entry IS AN `Entry by a tester or an expert under section 37`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(a)(1) — the senior inspector has reason to suppose that unlicensed or non-conforming work is done or engaged there` entry MEANS
        entry's `the senior inspector has reason to suppose that a person operating there does work on a cooling system without a licence or not in accordance with the conditions of his licence`
    OR  entry's `the senior inspector has reason to suppose that a person operating there engages another in such work without a licence or not in accordance with the conditions of the licence`

-- src:313 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} בודק או מומחה רשאי להשתמש בסמכותו לפי סעיף קטן (א)(1), רק בהתקיים כל אלה:
-- src:314 | {{ח:תתת|(1)}} הבודק או המומחה הציג את כתב הסמכתו למחזיק של המקום כאמור באותו סעיף קטן;
-- src:315 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} ניתנה הסכמה בכתב של המחזיק של המקום לכניסת הבודק או המומחה למקום;
-- src:316 | {{ח:תתת|(3)}} בטרם מתן ההסכמה כאמור בפסקה (2), ניתן למחזיק של המקום הסבר על מטרתן של בדיקות העזר או של הבדיקות לשם מתן חוות דעת מומחה, לפי העניין, וכן על זכותו לסרב לביצוע בדיקות כאמור ולחזור בו מהסכמתו עד לתחילת ביצוען;
-- src:317 | {{ח:תתת|(4)}} כניסה למקום המשמש לבית מגורים תהיה רק על פי בקשת המחזיק של בית המגורים ובתיאום מראש עימו.
-- s.37(b): the power of entry may be used "only if all of these": (1) he showed his instrument of authorisation
-- to the holder; (2) the holder gave written consent; (3) before consenting the holder was told the purpose of the
-- tests and of his right to refuse and to withdraw consent until they begin; (4) a dwelling only at the holder's
-- request and by prior arrangement.  Unlike s.31(3) there is no court-order route, and the consent has a form,
-- writing (trap T30).
@ref s.37(b)(1) (src:314)
GIVEN entry IS AN `Entry by a tester or an expert under section 37`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(b)(1) — the tester or expert showed his instrument of authorisation to the holder of the place` entry MEANS
    entry's `showed the instrument of authorisation to the holder of the place`

-- (2): the consent must have been given in writing.  If the holder withdrew it before the tests began (the right
-- (3) gives him), the consent no longer stands (fork F-WITHDRAW); the reading that ignores withdrawal follows.
@ref s.37(b)(2) (src:315)
GIVEN entry IS AN `Entry by a tester or an expert under section 37`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(b)(2) — the holder gave written consent to the entry, and it stands` entry MEANS
        entry's `the holder gave written consent to the entry`
    AND NOT entry's `the holder withdrew his consent before the tests began`

@ref s.37(b)(2) (src:315)
GIVEN entry IS AN `Entry by a tester or an expert under section 37`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(b)(2), withdrawal ignored — the holder gave written consent to the entry` entry MEANS
    entry's `the holder gave written consent to the entry`

@ref s.37(b)(3) (src:316)
GIVEN entry IS AN `Entry by a tester or an expert under section 37`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(b)(3) — before consenting the holder was told the purpose of the tests and of his rights to refuse and to withdraw consent` entry MEANS
        "purpose" ... entry's `the holder was told the purpose of the tests`
    AND "right to refuse" ... entry's `the holder was told of his right to refuse the tests`
    AND "right to withdraw" ... entry's `the holder was told of his right to withdraw consent until the tests begin`
    AND "before consent" ... entry's `the holder was told all this before he gave consent`

-- (4): "entry to a place used as a dwelling will be only at the holder's request and by prior arrangement": for a
-- dwelling both, for any other place nothing.
@ref s.37(b)(4) (src:317)
GIVEN entry IS AN `Entry by a tester or an expert under section 37`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(b)(4) — a dwelling is entered only at the holder's request and by prior arrangement` entry MEANS
        (NOT entry's `used as a dwelling`)
    OR  (    entry's `the holder asked for the entry`
         AND entry's `the entry was arranged with the holder in advance` )

@ref s.37(b) (src:313-317)
@export Whether the conditions of s.37(b) of the Law for a tester's or expert's entry are all met: he showed his instrument of authorisation, the holder gave written consent after being told the purpose of the tests and of his rights to refuse and to withdraw, and, for a dwelling, entry is at the holder's request and by prior arrangement
GIVEN entry IS AN `Entry by a tester or an expert under section 37` @desc The entry: what the holder was shown and told, whether he consented in writing and did not withdraw, whether the place is a dwelling and whether he asked for the entry and arranged it
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(b) — all the conditions of entry are met` entry MEANS
        "(1)" ... `s 37(b)(1) — the tester or expert showed his instrument of authorisation to the holder of the place` entry
    AND "(2)" ... `s 37(b)(2) — the holder gave written consent to the entry, and it stands` entry
    AND "(3)" ... `s 37(b)(3) — before consenting the holder was told the purpose of the tests and of his rights to refuse and to withdraw consent` entry
    AND "(4)" ... `s 37(b)(4) — a dwelling is entered only at the holder's request and by prior arrangement` entry

@ref s.37(b) (src:313-317)
GIVEN entry IS AN `Entry by a tester or an expert under section 37`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(b), withdrawal ignored — all the conditions of entry are met` entry MEANS
        `s 37(b)(1) — the tester or expert showed his instrument of authorisation to the holder of the place` entry
    AND `s 37(b)(2), withdrawal ignored — the holder gave written consent to the entry` entry
    AND `s 37(b)(3) — before consenting the holder was told the purpose of the tests and of his rights to refuse and to withdraw consent` entry
    AND `s 37(b)(4) — a dwelling is entered only at the holder's request and by prior arrangement` entry

@ref s.37(a)(1), (b) (src:308, src:313-317)
@export Whether a tester or expert may enter a place under s.37(a)(1) of the Law: he holds the power (authorised, acting for an auxiliary test or expert opinion, within his instrument), the senior inspector has reason to suppose unlicensed or non-conforming work is done or engaged there, and all the conditions of s.37(b) are met. Unlike an inspector (s.31(3)) he has no court-order route
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work` @desc The tester or expert and his standing: capacity, authorisation in force, purpose, conditions of the instrument
      entry IS AN `Entry by a tester or an expert under section 37` @desc The entry and what the occupier was shown, told and agreed
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(a)(1) — the tester or expert may enter the place` who entry MEANS
        `s 37(a) — the tester or expert holds the power: authorised, acting for a purpose that fits his capacity, within the conditions of his instrument, the Law having commenced for the work` who
    AND `s 37(a)(1) — the senior inspector has reason to suppose that unlicensed or non-conforming work is done or engaged there` entry
    AND `s 37(b) — all the conditions of entry are met` entry

@ref s.37(a)(1), (b) (src:308, src:313-317)
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work`
      entry IS AN `Entry by a tester or an expert under section 37`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(a)(1), withdrawal ignored — the tester or expert may enter the place` who entry MEANS
        `s 37(a) — the tester or expert holds the power: authorised, acting for a purpose that fits his capacity, within the conditions of his instrument, the Law having commenced for the work` who
    AND `s 37(a)(1) — the senior inspector has reason to suppose that unlicensed or non-conforming work is done or engaged there` entry
    AND `s 37(b), withdrawal ignored — all the conditions of entry are met` entry

@ref s.37(a)(1), (b) (src:308, src:313-317)
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work`
      entry IS AN `Entry by a tester or an expert under section 37`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 37(a)(1) — a tester or expert may enter a place` who entry MEANS
    PARTY `s 37 — the party acting as` who
    MAY   `use a power of a tester or an expert` `enter a place for the purpose of auxiliary tests or an expert opinion`
          PROVIDED `s 37(a)(1) — the tester or expert may enter the place` who entry

-- "May use ... only if all of these": outside the conditions the entry is forbidden.
@ref s.37(b) (src:313-317)
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work`
      entry IS AN `Entry by a tester or an expert under section 37`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 37(b) — a tester or expert shall not enter a place unless all the conditions are met` who entry MEANS
    PARTY `s 37 — the party acting as` who
    SHANT `use a power of a tester or an expert` `enter a place for the purpose of auxiliary tests or an expert opinion`
          PROVIDED NOT `s 37(b) — all the conditions of entry are met` entry
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `s 37 — the party acting as` who BECAUSE "s 37(b): a tester or expert entered a place without meeting all the conditions of entry"

-- src:309 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} לדרוש ממבצע עבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר למסור לו את שמו ומענו ולהציג לפניו תעודת זהות או תעודה רשמית אחרת המזהה אותו;
-- s.37(a)(2): the demand for name, address and identification is addressed to "a person doing work on a cooling
-- system" (s.31(1): "any person").  No identification of the tester is asked for it, unlike s.32 for an inspector.
@ref s.37(a)(2) (src:309)
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work`
      `the person is doing work on a cooling system` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(a)(2) — the tester or expert may require the person doing the work to give his name and address and to show identification` who `the person is doing work on a cooling system` MEANS
        `s 37(a) — the tester or expert holds the power: authorised, acting for a purpose that fits his capacity, within the conditions of his instrument, the Law having commenced for the work` who
    AND `the person is doing work on a cooling system`

@ref s.37(a)(2) (src:309)
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work`
      `the person is doing work on a cooling system` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 37(a)(2) — a tester or expert may require a person doing work on a cooling system to give his name and address and to show identification` who `the person is doing work on a cooling system` MEANS
    PARTY `s 37 — the party acting as` who
    MAY   `use a power of a tester or an expert` `require the person doing the work to give his name and address and to show identification`
          PROVIDED `s 37(a)(2) — the tester or expert may require the person doing the work to give his name and address and to show identification` who `the person is doing work on a cooling system`

-- src:310 | {{ח:תתת|(3)}} להשתמש ברשימת תיוג; רשימת התיוג, ובכלל זה רשימת המסמכים הרשמיים הנדרשים לשם קביעת הממצאים, תפורסם ברשומות ובאתר האינטרנט של המשרד;
-- s.37(a)(3): "to use a checklist"; the checklist, with the list of official documents required to establish the
-- findings, "will be published" in Reshumot and on the Ministry's website.  The text names no publisher: the
-- senior inspector, who sets the checklist (s.33 def.7), is inferred (fork F-ACTOR); the party is a parameter.
-- Publication is read as a duty, not as a condition of the power to use the checklist (fork F-PUBLISH); the
-- reading that makes it a condition follows.
@ref s.37(a)(3) (src:310)
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work`
      list IS A `Checklist used by a tester or an expert`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(a)(3) — the tester or expert may use the checklist` who list MEANS
        `s 37(a) — the tester or expert holds the power: authorised, acting for a purpose that fits his capacity, within the conditions of his instrument, the Law having commenced for the work` who
    AND list's `set by the senior inspector for the carrying out of an auxiliary test`

@ref s.37(a)(3) (src:310)
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work`
      list IS A `Checklist used by a tester or an expert`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(a)(3), publication read as a condition of use — the tester or expert may use the checklist` who list MEANS
        `s 37(a)(3) — the tester or expert may use the checklist` who list
    AND list's `published in Reshumot and on the Ministry website`

@ref s.37(a)(3) (src:310)
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work`
      list IS A `Checklist used by a tester or an expert`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 37(a)(3) — a tester or expert may use a checklist` who list MEANS
    PARTY `s 37 — the party acting as` who
    MAY   `use a power of a tester or an expert` `use a checklist`
          PROVIDED `s 37(a)(3) — the tester or expert may use the checklist` who list

@ref s.37(a)(3) (src:310)
GIVEN publisher IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 37(a)(3) — the checklist shall be published in Reshumot and on the Ministry website by` publisher MEANS
    PARTY publisher
    MUST  `publish the checklist in Reshumot and on the Ministry website`

@ref s.37(a)(3) (src:310)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 37(a)(3) — the senior inspector shall have the checklist published in Reshumot and on the Ministry website` MEANS
    `s 37(a)(3) — the checklist shall be published in Reshumot and on the Ministry website by` `the senior inspector`

-- src:311 | {{ח:תתת|(4)}} לקבל מכל אדם הנוגע לעניין מסמכים או ידיעות המופיעים ברשימת התיוג;
-- s.37(a)(4): a tester or expert may RECEIVE (the verb at src:311) documents or information from any person concerned, as far as
-- they appear in the checklist.  He may not require them: contrast s.31(2), "require" (the verb at src:258), whose breach
-- Third Schedule item (7) prices.  A request by a tester or expert is not a demand under s.31(2).
@ref s.37(a)(4) (src:311)
GIVEN request IS A `Request for documents or information under a checklist`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(a)(4) — the documents or information may be received: the person is concerned and they appear in the checklist` request MEANS
        request's `the person from whom they are requested is concerned in the matter`
    AND request's `they appear in the checklist`

@ref s.37(a)(4) (src:311)
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work`
      request IS A `Request for documents or information under a checklist`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(a)(4) — the tester or expert may receive the documents or information` who request MEANS
        `s 37(a) — the tester or expert holds the power: authorised, acting for a purpose that fits his capacity, within the conditions of his instrument, the Law having commenced for the work` who
    AND `s 37(a)(4) — the documents or information may be received: the person is concerned and they appear in the checklist` request

@ref s.37(a)(4) (src:311)
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work`
      request IS A `Request for documents or information under a checklist`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 37(a)(4) — a tester or expert may receive from a person concerned the documents or information in the checklist` who request MEANS
    PARTY `s 37 — the party acting as` who
    MAY   `use a power of a tester or an expert` `receive from a person concerned the documents or information that appear in the checklist`
          PROVIDED `s 37(a)(4) — the tester or expert may receive the documents or information` who request

-- src:312 | {{ח:תתת|(5)}} לבצע בדיקות במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר.
@ref s.37(a)(5) (src:312)
GIVEN who IS A `Tester or expert at work`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 37(a)(5) — a tester or expert may carry out tests on a cooling system` who MEANS
    PARTY `s 37 — the party acting as` who
    MAY   `use a power of a tester or an expert` `carry out tests on a cooling system`
          PROVIDED `s 37(a) — the tester or expert holds the power: authorised, acting for a purpose that fits his capacity, within the conditions of his instrument, the Law having commenced for the work` who

§§ `s 38 -- Information security and confidentiality`

-- src:319 | {{ח:סעיף|38|חובת אבטחת מידע וסודיות}}
-- src:320 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} גוף בודק או מומחה, שבוצעה עימו התקשרות בהתאם להוראות {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 34|סעיף 34(ג)}}, אחראי לאבטחת המידע המתקבל אצלו ואצל מי מטעמו אגב ביצוע כל פעולה בידו או בידי מי מטעמו מכוח ההתקשרות כאמור (בסעיף זה – פעולה מכוח ההתקשרות), ובכלל זה מניעת שימוש לרעה במידע, פיקוח ובקרה על הגישה למידע ועל השימוש בו ואבטחה של מערכות המחשוב שבהן המידע מוחזק.
-- s.38(a): a testing body or expert "with whom an engagement was made in accordance with s.34(c)" is responsible
-- for the security of information received by him or by anyone on his behalf in the course of an act under the
-- engagement, "including preventing misuse of the information, supervising and controlling access to it and its
-- use, and securing the computer systems in which it is held".  A duty of care, encoded as MUST: the act that
-- discharges it is securing the information, and the three named measures are required with an open residue.
@ref s.38(a) (src:320)
GIVEN measures IS A `Measures securing information under section 38(a)`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(a) — the measures secure the information: misuse prevented, access and use controlled, computer systems secured, nothing else left open` measures MEANS
        "misuse" ... measures's `misuse of the information is prevented`
    AND "access and use" ... measures's `access to the information and its use are supervised and controlled`
    AND "computer systems" ... measures's `the computer systems in which the information is held are secured`
    AND "any other aspect" ... measures's `any other aspect of security that the responsibility requires is secured`

@ref s.38(a) (src:320)
GIVEN who IS A Party
      engagement IS AN `Engagement for information security`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 38(a) — an engaged testing body or expert shall secure the information received in the course of an act under the engagement, the party bound being` who engagement MEANS
    IF   engagement's `made in accordance with section 34(c)`
    THEN PARTY who
         MUST  `secure the information received in the course of an act under the engagement` secured
               PROVIDED `s 38(a) — the measures secure the information: misuse prevented, access and use controlled, computer systems secured, nothing else left open` secured
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST  BREACH BY who BECAUSE "s 38(a): the information received in an act under the engagement was not secured"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref s.38(a) (src:320)
GIVEN engagement IS AN `Engagement for information security`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 38(a) — an engaged testing body shall secure the information` engagement MEANS
    `s 38(a) — an engaged testing body or expert shall secure the information received in the course of an act under the engagement, the party bound being` `a testing body` engagement

@ref s.38(a) (src:320)
GIVEN engagement IS AN `Engagement for information security`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 38(a) — an engaged expert shall secure the information` engagement MEANS
    `s 38(a) — an engaged testing body or expert shall secure the information received in the course of an act under the engagement, the party bound being` `an expert` engagement

-- src:321 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} הסתיימה התקשרות עם גוף בודק או מומחה כאמור בסעיף קטן (א), יעביר הגוף הבודק או המומחה, לפי העניין, את המידע שבידיו לידי המפקח הבכיר; נותר בידי הגוף הבודק או המומחה מידע לאחר ביצוע העברת המידע כאמור, ישמיד את המידע שהגיע אליו עקב ביצוע כל פעולה מכוח ההתקשרות, ויודיע על כך למפקח הבכיר.
-- s.38(b): when an engagement as in (a) ends, the body or expert shall hand the information to the senior
-- inspector; if information remains after the hand-over he shall destroy what reached him in an act under the
-- engagement and tell the senior inspector.  No time is stated for any of the three steps.
@ref s.38(b) (src:321)
GIVEN who IS A Party
      ending IS AN `End of an engagement under section 38(b)`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 38(b) — when the engagement ends the body or expert shall hand over the information, destroy what remains and tell the senior inspector, the party bound being` who ending MEANS
    IF   ending's `the engagement was made in accordance with section 34(c)` AND ending's `the engagement has ended`
    THEN PARTY who
         MUST  `hand the information to the senior inspector`
         HENCE ( IF   ending's `information remains after it was handed to the senior inspector`
                 THEN PARTY who
                      MUST  `destroy the information that remains`
                      HENCE ( PARTY who
                              MUST  `tell the senior inspector that the information was destroyed`
                              HENCE FULFILLED
                              LEST  BREACH BY who BECAUSE "s 38(b): the senior inspector was not told that the remaining information was destroyed" )
                      LEST  BREACH BY who BECAUSE "s 38(b): the information that remained after the hand-over was not destroyed"
                 ELSE FULFILLED )
         LEST  BREACH BY who BECAUSE "s 38(b): the information was not handed to the senior inspector when the engagement ended"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref s.38(b) (src:321)
GIVEN ending IS AN `End of an engagement under section 38(b)`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 38(b) — a testing body at the end of its engagement` ending MEANS
    `s 38(b) — when the engagement ends the body or expert shall hand over the information, destroy what remains and tell the senior inspector, the party bound being` `a testing body` ending

@ref s.38(b) (src:321)
GIVEN ending IS AN `End of an engagement under section 38(b)`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 38(b) — an expert at the end of his engagement` ending MEANS
    `s 38(b) — when the engagement ends the body or expert shall hand over the information, destroy what remains and tell the senior inspector, the party bound being` `an expert` ending

-- src:322 | {{ח:תת|(ג)}} גוף בודק ועובדיו לרבות בודק, וכן מומחה, לא יגלו מידע שהגיע אליהם עקב ביצוע פעולה מכוח ההתקשרות ולא יעשו בו כל שימוש, אלא לשם ביצוע הפעולה.
-- s.38(c): a testing body, its employees including a tester, and an expert "will not disclose" information that
-- reached them in an act under the engagement "and will not make any use of it except to carry out the act".
-- A prohibition without a period: it holds for good.  The party is a parameter; the employees who are not
-- testers have no Party constructor in the domain (nouns request in FRAGMENT-G5.md), so `a person` stands in for
-- them and the rule is guarded by their being employees of a testing body.
-- The one exception to the prohibition is "except to carry out the act".  Taken literally it forbids what the Law
-- itself orders: the reports of s.34(d) and (e) and the hand-over of s.38(b) disclose information obtained in an act
-- under the engagement and are not, strictly, carrying out the act (fork F-DISCLOSE).  Reading taken: a disclosure
-- the Law requires is not caught; the literal reading follows.
@ref s.38(c) (src:322)
GIVEN `in order to perform the act` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Law requires it under section 34(d), 34(e) or 38(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(c) — the disclosure or use is permitted` `in order to perform the act` `the Law requires it under section 34(d), 34(e) or 38(b)` MEANS
        `in order to perform the act`
    OR  `the Law requires it under section 34(d), 34(e) or 38(b)`

@ref s.38(c) (src:322)
GIVEN `in order to perform the act` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Law requires it under section 34(d), 34(e) or 38(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 38(c), literally — the disclosure or use is permitted` `in order to perform the act` `the Law requires it under section 34(d), 34(e) or 38(b)` MEANS
    `in order to perform the act`

@ref s.38(c) (src:322)
GIVEN who IS A Party
      information IS AN `Information obtained by a tester, an expert or a testing body`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 38(c) — the party shall not disclose or use information obtained in an act under the engagement except to carry out the act, the party bound being` who information MEANS
    IF   information's `obtained in an act under an engagement made in accordance with section 34(c)`
    THEN PARTY who
         SHANT `disclose or use information obtained in an act under the engagement` inOrderToPerformTheAct requiredByTheLaw
               PROVIDED NOT `s 38(c) — the disclosure or use is permitted` inOrderToPerformTheAct requiredByTheLaw
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST  BREACH BY who BECAUSE "s 38(c): information obtained in an act under the engagement was disclosed or used for something other than carrying out the act"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref s.38(c) (src:322)
GIVEN information IS AN `Information obtained by a tester, an expert or a testing body`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 38(c) — a testing body shall not disclose or use the information` information MEANS
    `s 38(c) — the party shall not disclose or use information obtained in an act under the engagement except to carry out the act, the party bound being` `a testing body` information

@ref s.38(c) (src:322)
GIVEN information IS AN `Information obtained by a tester, an expert or a testing body`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 38(c) — a tester shall not disclose or use the information` information MEANS
    `s 38(c) — the party shall not disclose or use information obtained in an act under the engagement except to carry out the act, the party bound being` `a tester` information

@ref s.38(c) (src:322)
GIVEN information IS AN `Information obtained by a tester, an expert or a testing body`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 38(c) — an expert shall not disclose or use the information` information MEANS
    `s 38(c) — the party shall not disclose or use information obtained in an act under the engagement except to carry out the act, the party bound being` `an expert` information

@ref s.38(c) (src:322)
GIVEN employeeOfATestingBody IS A BOOLEAN
      information IS AN `Information obtained by a tester, an expert or a testing body`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 37 and 38`
`s 38(c) — an employee of a testing body who is not a tester shall not disclose or use the information` employeeOfATestingBody information MEANS
    IF   employeeOfATestingBody
    THEN `s 38(c) — the party shall not disclose or use information obtained in an act under the engagement except to carry out the act, the party bound being` `a person` information
    ELSE FULFILLED
